{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shade:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person psychological horror game inspired by real life terrors. Desperate for work you take a job as a manor housekeeper in the deep countryside of Finland. Do your job, explore and stay alert for those who lurk in the shadows.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur Bell, a troubled young man who took a job opportunity in the Finnish countryside. Travel deeper into the countryside, find the employer and get further information about the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.poster.avif?t=1761975642\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.webm?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/08363fe57ecc0bafa03878ae2bdb4621.mp4?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Manor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job as a manor housekeeper consists of different tasks and events at the manor. The game is divided into days that all hold new tasks, exploration and deep storylines. Keep the manor intact and find different usable items.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.poster.avif?t=1761975642\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.webm?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/c5c216774439ac662beddad4cba04c0f.mp4?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are Not Alone:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forests around you hold all kinds of people, items and quests you can participate in. Explore your surroundings, if you are brave enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/7c701c72de5d1bc307f6ee7673b989e1.poster.avif?t=1761975642\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/7c701c72de5d1bc307f6ee7673b989e1.webm?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712390/extras/7c701c72de5d1bc307f6ee7673b989e1.mp4?t=1761975642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue with characters that give player different answering options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment that you can explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fear creating scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using items and completing quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i